  "description": "Suyeon spends a dizzying night with her friend's older brother! She believed it would just end as a single mistake... But this man keeps getting under her skin the more she tries to ignore him, and the more she draws the line, the bolder he gets! Between love and friendship, a relationship that must not be found out, and an irresistible attraction. A precarious tightrope walk begins with the perfect and dangerous friend's older brother, 'Ryu Itae'!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=857377), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14975035)",
